2026-11-07T07:08:12.8845960Z 
2026-11-07T07:08:12.8848880Z I will:
2026-11-07T07:08:12.8849980Z 
2026-11-07T07:08:12.8851790Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-11-07T07:08:12.8853500Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-11-07T07:08:12.8854050Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-11-07T07:08:12.8854480Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-07T07:08:12.8854800Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-07T07:08:12.8855120Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-07T07:08:12.8855680Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-07T07:08:12.8856100Z    /var/root
