2026-11-07T07:08:12.8915250Z  - update /etc/bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-07T07:08:12.8965690Z  - back up /etc/zshrc to /etc/zshrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-07T07:08:12.8966790Z  - update /etc/zshrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-07T07:08:12.8967920Z  - create a Nix volume and a LaunchDaemon to mount it
2026-11-07T07:08:12.8969160Z  - create a LaunchDaemon (at /Library/LaunchDaemons/org.nixos.nix-daemon.plist) for nix-daemon
